      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      409.14,
      295.23,
      467.1
    ],
    "text": "I, Munasinghe Kariyawasam Appuhamilage Don SomadasaGunawardana, Minister of Lands, hereby declare, under Sub-section(1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land describedbelow is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      481.14,
      295.2,
      551.1
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called Bibile Kumbura in total extent of0.0154 Hectare, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KE/GLG/2014/249 of 29.10.2014, prepared by the Surveyor-General,situated in the Village of Bisowela in the Minor Division ofBeligal Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Galigamuwain Kegalle District and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.17,
      370.74,
      547.18,
      415.14
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Bibile Kumbura (Currently used as high land)\u2013 Extent: 0.0154 HectareNorth: Bibile Kumbura and Road (P.S.); East: Road (P.S.); Southand West: Bibile Kumbura.",
